      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would also be fine just saying \"openshift\u003dtrue\" instead of \"use_openshift_projects\u003dtrue\".  In my mind, the difference is whether we will ever have any other openshift-specific behaviors, and if so, whether we would want to enable them individually, or all of them together.  When I wrote this, I thought \"individually\".  But would be happy to change it.",
      "revId": "cf0dd456f36743341b2c0e24e1f1a7234ef0a5ba",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
    {
