        "id": 27582
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-18T14:57:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, I guess in that case I think it\u0027s better to call this `use_openshift_projects`. Using `openshift\u003dtrue` sounds like you\u0027d always need to set this to true when using OpenShift.",
